       AbilityTargetingHelper.BuildTargetingStartAnnouncement. {0} = ability
       label; other placeholders are inserted as their own fragments so that
       the sentence reads naturally even when some pieces are omitted. -->
  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Start.Fallback>Mira de habilidade</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Start.Fallback>
  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Start.Header>Mira: {0}</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Start.Header>
  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Start.TouchRange>. Alcance de toque</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Start.TouchRange>
  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Start.Range>. Alcance: {0} células</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Start.Range>
  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Start.AOE>, Raio de efeito: {0} células</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Start.AOE>
  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Start.Psyfocus>. Concentração psíquica: {0}</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Start.Psyfocus>
  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Start.NeuralHeat>, Calor neural: {0}</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Start.NeuralHeat>
  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Start.HintAoe>. Pressione R para verificar distância e linha de visão, T para ver os alvos afetados.</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Start.HintAoe>
  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Start.HintSingle>. Pressione R para verificar distância e linha de visão.</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Start.HintSingle>

  <!-- Range/LOS/target feedback built by AbilityTargetingHelper.
       BuildRangeInfoAnnouncement. {0} = distance; {1} = max range.
       InRange/OutOfRange forms are dedicated so translators can reorder
       subject, distance, and verdict freely; NoTargetAtCursor takes the
       target-kind word as {0}. -->
  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Range.NoAbilityActive>Nenhuma habilidade ativa</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Range.NoAbilityActive>
  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Range.Distance>Distância: {0} células</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Range.Distance>
  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Range.InRange>, DENTRO DO ALCANCE</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Range.InRange>
  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Range.OutOfRange>, FORA DE ALCANCE (máx {0})</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Range.OutOfRange>
  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Range.InRangeTouch>, DENTRO DO ALCANCE (toque)</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Range.InRangeTouch>
  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Range.MustBeAdjacent>, deve estar adjacente (alcance de toque)</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Range.MustBeAdjacent>
  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Range.NoLineOfSight>, SEM LINHA DE VISÃO</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Range.NoLineOfSight>
  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Range.NoTargetAtCursor>. Sem {0} no cursor</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Range.NoTargetAtCursor>

