       announcement. StartFallback/StartHeader replace the English
       "Targeting"/"X targeting" literals; StartTypeDesc wraps the already-
       translated type description from TargetingParametersDescriber;
       StartRangeMinMax covers the min-to-max range case; StartExplosionRadius
